            </note>
            <note corresp="#d587-f2" n="2" xml:id="d587-f2-content">
                <p>These remarks occurred during Dulles’ oral briefing on recent world developments,
                    which constituted NSC Action No. 2318. (Department of State, S/S–NSC
                    (Miscellaneous) Files: Lot 66 D 95, Records of Action by the National Security
                    Council)</p>
            </note>
